                                        "text": "*Likely cause:* no likely commit identified \u2014 No commit in the last 48h scored above 0.15 for this service\nNo recent commit plausibly explains this \u2014 the certificate itself has expired ('certificate has expired' in client errors), which is an infrastructure expiry, not a code change.",
